# 💬 LLM-Powered Document Q&A System (RAG)

> Chat with your documents using AI — powered by Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), multi-LLM support, and real-time streaming.

---

## ⚡ Overview

This project is a **production-style RAG system** that allows users to upload documents (PDF/DOCX) and interact with them conversationally using modern Large Language Models.

Unlike basic demos, this system focuses on:

* **Real-time streaming responses (ChatGPT-like UX)**
* **Multi-LLM support (OpenAI, Cohere, Hugging Face)**
* **Context-aware conversations with memory**
* **Scalable architecture with vector search (FAISS)**

---

## 🌐 Live Demo

👉 [https://rag-portfolio-zeta.vercel.app/](https://rag-portfolio-zeta.vercel.app/)

---

## 🎯 Key Features

### 🧠 AI & Retrieval

* Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
* Semantic search using **FAISS vector database**
* Embeddings via `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`
* Intelligent document chunking

---

### 🤖 Multi-LLM Support

* OpenAI (GPT models)
* Cohere (Command models)
* Hugging Face (open models)

✔ Dynamic model selection
✔ Unified abstraction layer (`BaseLLM`)
✔ Handles provider inconsistencies

---

### 💬 ChatGPT-Level UX

* Real-time **token streaming**
* Chat-style interface (Streamlit)
* Typing cursor effect (`▌`)
* Clean, responsive UI

---

### 📂 Document Intelligence

* Upload **multiple PDFs & DOCX files**
* Automatic text extraction
* Persistent vector index (no reprocessing)

---

### 🧠 Conversational Memory

* Remembers recent chat history
* Context-aware follow-up questions

---

### 📚 Source Transparency

* View retrieved document chunks
* Understand how answers are generated

---

### 💾 Export Chat

* Download full conversation as `.txt`

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```
User Query
   ↓
Retriever (FAISS)
   ↓
Relevant Chunks
   ↓
LLM (OpenAI / Cohere / HF)
   ↓
Streaming Response
```

---

## 🔄 Application Flow

1. 🔐 User enters API key
2. 🤖 Selects LLM provider & model
3. 📄 Uploads document(s)
4. ✂️ Text is chunked & embedded
5. 🧠 Stored in FAISS vector DB
6. ❓ User asks a question
7. 🔍 Relevant chunks retrieved
8. 💬 LLM generates answer (streamed live)

---

## ⚡ Streaming Implementation

| Provider     | Method              |
| ------------ | ------------------- |
| OpenAI       | `stream=True`       |
| Cohere       | `chat_stream()`     |
| Hugging Face | Simulated streaming |

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
rag-qa/
│
├── app/
│   ├── services.py        # RAG pipeline + LLM abstraction
│   ├── main.py            # FastAPI backend (optional)
│   └── routes.py
│
├── dashboard/
│   └── app.py             # Streamlit UI
│
├── vectorstore_index/     # FAISS index
├── .env
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Setup & Installation

### 1. Clone

```bash
git clone https://github.com/emekaphilian/AI-ML-Projects.git
cd AI-ML-Projects
```

---

### 2. Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv .venv
```

Activate:

```bash
# Windows
.venv\Scripts\activate

# macOS/Linux
source .venv/bin/activate
```

---

### 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

### 4. Configure API Keys

Create `.env`:

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key
COHERE_API_KEY=your_key
HF_API_TOKEN=your_token
```

---

## ▶️ Run the App

### Streamlit UI

```bash
streamlit run dashboard/app.py
```

Open:

```
http://localhost:8501
```

---

### (Optional) FastAPI Backend

```bash
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

