## 🧠 Technical Highlights

### 🔹 LLM Abstraction Layer

```python
BaseLLM → OpenAI / Cohere / HuggingFace
```

* Handles API differences
* Enables plug-and-play LLM switching

---

### 🔹 Efficient Retrieval

* FAISS vector search
* Top-k similarity matching
* Context injection into prompt

---

### 🔹 Smart Chunking

* Overlapping chunks
* Preserves semantic meaning
* Improves retrieval accuracy

---

## ⚠️ Challenges & Solutions

### ❌ Problem: Fake Streaming UX

✔ Solution: Implemented real token streaming

---

### ❌ Problem: API Differences

✔ Solution: Built unified LLM interface

---

### ❌ Problem: Too Many HF Models

✔ Solution: Filtered relevant models

---

### ❌ Problem: Poor Retrieval Quality

✔ Solution: Improved chunking strategy

